  "description_en": "Queries the events of a specified cluster. Cluster operation events include cluster creation, cluster modification, node pool creation, node pool scaling, add-on installation, and cluster upgrades. You can call this operation to retrieve a list of events that occurred in the cluster and query event details, including the event level, event status, and event time",
